  "explanation": "Singular: this (near) | that (far)\nPlural: these (near) | those (far)\n\nThis is my phone. (here) | That is your car. (over there)\nThese are my keys. | Those are nice shoes.\n\nQuestions: What is this? | What are those?",
  "grammar": {
